    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26144" root="ضوز" body-key="D">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَازَهُ حَقَّهُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُوزُهُ</span>, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَازَهُ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضِيزُهُ</span>:
see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضيز</span>. (K.) You say also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَازَنِى</span>, aor.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُوزُنِى</span>, meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَصَنِى</span> [<i>He made me to suffer
loss</i>]. (Kr, M, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَازَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُوزُ</span> is
also [intrans.] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأَزَ</span>, q. v. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضأز</span>.)

